A quoted row attribute value may hold a pipe

```
| a |{a="x|y"}
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr a="x|y"><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |{a='x|y|z' .c}
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr a="x|y|z" class="c"><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|= a |{a="|"}
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr a="|"><th scope="col">a</th></tr>
  </thead>
</table>
```
